WEBVTT

00:03:25.596 --> 00:03:31.556
that she can only take it in
through small, gasping breaths of pain.

00:03:34.116 --> 00:03:38.036
She alights with the others
on a featureless plain

00:03:38.036 --> 00:03:40.796
under a vast, brooding sky.

00:03:41.836 --> 00:03:44.876
There’s the boy
with the clock in his arms.

00:03:45.716 --> 00:03:50.436
The thumping of the girl’s heart
keeps time with the boy’s clock,

00:03:50.436 --> 00:03:52.636
an urgent, rapid beat.

00:03:53.156 --> 00:03:55.436
Tuck, tuck, tuck, tuck,
tick-tock, tick-tock.

00:03:56.556 --> 00:03:57.956
Something’s coming.